   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2018-10-23",
   "text": "Hospital Competition Act of 2018\n This bill establishes a series of programs and requirements relating to hospital costs, payments, and infrastructure, including a requirement for hospitals, as a condition of Medicare participation, to publish the prices charged for specified services that are highly utilized."
